window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sound interesting? The author thinks so too! Listen to <i>Lost to the Moon</i> and experience the compelling world of The Mate Games: Pestilence.</p> <p>Warning: The Mate Games: Pestilence is a spicy why-choose series that is sure to set your...heart...on fire. If you’re not a fan of grumpy dukes with a penchant for pain, purple demons with fancy body parts, nosy hackers with boundary issues, angsty wolf shifters who like to share, sword crossing, and plenty of group activities, this one’s not for you. But if it is...welcome back to The Mate Games, we’ve been waiting for you.</p>"; 
